1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:03,260
Cinderella

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:12,420
Cinderella's Sister

3
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:44,580
Cinderella's Sister

4
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,750
Episode 18

5
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,550
Eun Jo.

6
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:02,320
𝘞𝘩𝘢𝘵 𝘪𝘴 𝘩𝘢𝘱𝘱𝘦𝘯𝘪𝘯𝘨?

7
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:05,570
𝘛𝘩𝘢𝘵 𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘴𝘰𝘯 𝘪𝘴 𝘤𝘳𝘢𝘻𝘺.

8
00:01:05,570 --> 00:01:08,100
𝘞𝘩𝘺 𝘪𝘴 𝘩𝘦 𝘤𝘢𝘭𝘭𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘮𝘦 𝘭𝘪𝘬𝘦 𝘵𝘩𝘢𝘵?

9
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:10,000
Come over here.

10
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:13,540
Did he forgot the sins he committed?

11
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:15,790
Why is he calling me like that?

12
00:01:17,530 --> 00:01:19,580
No matter how many times I call you,

13
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:34,190
Seems like you won't come to me again.

14
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:36,660
Then, I'll have to go to you.

15
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:57,680
Whenever I start talking to you...

16
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:00,650
I've never been able to finish what I started saying to you.

17
00:02:00,650 --> 00:02:05,490
Since before I'm done talking, you always turn and walk away so quickly.

18
00:02:05,490 --> 00:02:08,320
That's a very bad habit you have.

19
00:02:21,850 --> 00:02:23,320
Things to say to MMM

20
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:26,460
If you dare move a step before I'm done saying all these things I wrote on this list...

21
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:31,950
you'll get scolded by me you brat, all right?

22
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:38,420
1. No matter what happens, don't be alarmed.

23
00:02:40,450 --> 00:02:44,360
-What are you sa-
-Whatever happens, don't be surprised.

24
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:46,360
I'll take care of all of it.

25
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,810
What happened?

26
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:54,050
2. And believe that Dae Seong True Winemakers will be safe.

27
00:02:54,050 --> 00:02:56,810
If you endure this well,

28
00:02:56,810 --> 00:03:00,400
And even if an earthquake occurs, you won't be shaken.

29
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,530
What in the world are you sa-

30
00:03:01,530 --> 00:03:03,400
3.

31
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:06,420
Something happened to the winery while I was gone, right?

32
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:08,500
Don't hesitate, but say it quickly.

33
00:03:08,530 --> 00:03:13,360
3. You keep your mouth shut.

34
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,520
What in the world is thi-

35
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:18,520
3. You keep your mouth shut.

36
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,680
Don't even let out a peep.

37
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,470
Do not cry.

38
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:24,850
Do not even scream.

39
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:30,320
Just like when you had a piece of glass stuck in your knee, but you didn't make a sound.

40
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:35,350
Of course, I didn't really like what you did back then but...

41
00:03:35,350 --> 00:03:38,990
Just this one time, do that for me,

42
00:03:38,990 --> 00:03:42,190
or it'll be hard for me.

43
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:44,940
You won't tell me straight out?

44
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,570
As far as number 4...

45
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:49,100
When everything is over,

46
00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:52,660
and I can still see your face at that time...

47
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:55,040
I will tell you then.

48
00:03:56,520 --> 00:04:00,550
Keep that note safe. It's very important.

49
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,870
What are you doing right now?

50
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:05,920
Are you joking now?

51
00:04:09,010 --> 00:04:12,500
What is this about? What are you saying is going to happen?

52
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:15,620
What's going to happen is not important, but what's important is that

53
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:19,750
this will all ultimately pass..

54
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:23,310
That it will all be taken care of, like nothing ever happened.

55
00:04:23,970 --> 00:04:25,980
You just have to know that.

56
00:04:56,370 --> 00:04:58,170
Grandfather.

57
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:02,060
Ahjussi Dang Sook.

58
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:04,750
Grandmother.

59
00:05:05,380 --> 00:05:10,390
So are you now saying without discussing it with us,

60
00:05:10,390 --> 00:05:15,340
that you went along and decided for yourselves?

61
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,870
That isn't the case, right?

62
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:22,850
I heard wrong, right?

63
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:33,730
Of course, you have shareholder's rights to Dae Seong True Winemakers.

64
00:05:33,730 --> 00:05:36,220
So you have the right to make a decision on this...

65
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:39,200
I know you do and I understand all that but...

66
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:42,940
𝘞𝘩𝘢𝘵𝘦𝘷𝘦𝘳 𝘩𝘢𝘱𝘱𝘦𝘯𝘴, 𝘥𝘰𝘯'𝘵 𝘣𝘦 𝘢𝘭𝘢𝘳𝘮𝘦𝘥.

67
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:46,600
Believe that Dae Seong True Winemakers will be safe.

68
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:50,390
But still the winery...

69
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:53,710
Dad...

70
00:05:55,890 --> 00:06:00,700
What I mean is... This winery is not just any ordinary winery...

71
00:06:02,210 --> 00:06:04,700
It's Dae Seong True Winemakers.

72
00:06:05,850 --> 00:06:09,590
Dae Seong True Winemakers must remain Dae Seong True Winemakers forever.

73
00:06:09,610 --> 00:06:12,690
Passing it on to someone else's hands... That...

74
00:06:12,690 --> 00:06:14,180
Hyo Seon.

75
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,880
Yes.

76
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:20,960
Yes, Grandpa.

77
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:23,440
Let's begin the process quickly.

78
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:28,090
Anyway, we can't afford to leave it to young guys like you forever.

79
00:06:28,090 --> 00:06:32,660
By doing this, we judged that t wouldn't cause any financial loss to you guys either.

80
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:36,670
Grandfather, this isn't about any loss.

81
00:06:36,670 --> 00:06:39,790
How can Dae Seong True Winemakers be handed to someone else?

82
00:06:39,790 --> 00:06:44,310
We understand well what the elders' thoughts are.

83
00:06:45,650 --> 00:06:50,080
Even if Hyo Seon, our mother, and I put our shares together,

84
00:06:50,110 --> 00:06:56,340
I understand well that if the elders are of one mind, we will have to follow.

85
00:06:56,340 --> 00:06:58,450
Unni.

86
00:06:58,450 --> 00:07:00,950
But, elders...

87
00:07:00,970 --> 00:07:07,230
do you know who's fault it was that Dae Seong True Winemakers suddenly started faltering?

88
00:07:07,230 --> 00:07:10,990
It was because of the shameless attacks of Hong Joo Ga,

89
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:14,780
who you are planning to sell your shares to.

90
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:16,520
And our...

91
00:07:18,710 --> 00:07:25,790
And our dad wouldn't have collapsed like that if it weren't for them.

92
00:07:27,110 --> 00:07:33,080
When our dad passed away like that, weren't you all sincere in grieving for him, right?

93
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:35,110
It was a waste.

94
00:07:35,110 --> 00:07:37,760
Didn't you say it was such a waste to have lost him and what you were supposed to do?

95
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:43,110
Didn't you cry over the fact that we lost the pillar of this family?

96
00:07:43,110 --> 00:07:45,990
I really remember it very clearly.

97
00:07:45,990 --> 00:07:50,800
How did such sincere feelings fade away so quickly?

98
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:55,790
I also remember so clearly how you told us that the dream our dad couldn't achieve,

99
00:07:55,790 --> 00:07:58,710
we must achieve it at all costs.

100
00:07:58,710 --> 00:08:03,200
How can you make such a decision so lightly without caring for anything else?

101
00:08:04,020 --> 00:08:08,690
If you were really sincere in what you've said to us, you wouldn't do this.

102
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:11,080
Elders, you can't do this to us.

103
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:14,760
Child, you are not supposed to talk right now.

104
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,400
Shut your mouth.

105
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,410
Grandmother.

106
00:08:17,410 --> 00:08:19,480
Considering how your mother behaves

107
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:23,210
how dare you preach to your elders?

108
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:34,040
Grandmother.

109
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,720
Why are you all like this?

110
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,910
Did I say something wrong?

111
00:08:41,910 --> 00:08:45,560
Does this child have the right to say such things to us?

112
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:47,480
That's all I'm saying.

113
00:08:48,300 --> 00:08:52,250
Don't talk carelessly about my mom, Grandmother!

114
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:57,760
Have you ever followed our mom around and seen her bad behaviour?

115
00:08:57,760 --> 00:09:01,560
Do you have any proof? Is there a single person who has seen her?

116
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:04,680
I've lived with her and I'm telling you that it's not true.

117
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:07,340
If our mom really did such a thing,

118
00:09:07,340 --> 00:09:10,820
I'm the one who could never forgive her.

119
00:09:11,810 --> 00:09:17,980
I've told you so many times that it wasn't true!

120
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:21,250
Even if she did that,

121
00:09:21,250 --> 00:09:25,020
Even if there was the odd chance that such a thing happened,

122
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:31,000
you can't say things like that.

123
00:09:32,450 --> 00:09:35,550
For my younger brother Joon Soo's sake,

124
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,120
you shouldn't do that, Grandmother.

125
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:43,610
Aigoo. Who knows if that kid is really your younger brother?

126
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,870
Unni.

127
00:09:51,090 --> 00:09:54,730
If he is or not, how can anyone know?

128
00:09:54,730 --> 00:09:56,880
Since we're on the topic

129
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,050
since that person came to our home

130
00:09:59,050 --> 00:10:02,650
think about how much money that person took or threw away outside?

131
00:10:02,650 --> 00:10:04,450
Grandmother!

132
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:12,260
If that was all true,

133
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,440
what would you do about it?

134
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:16,370
What did you say?

135
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:22,860
Even if it's all true, there is nothing you can do to my mother.

136
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:28,970
You can't bring someone back from the dead to sign the divorce papers.

137
00:10:28,970 --> 00:10:32,460
You don't have the right to remove her from the family registry.

138
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:37,550
Our mother has nothing to do with this situation.

139
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:40,180
This, this, this, this... rude child!

140
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:44,220
How dare you speak like that in front of your elders. Where you're going...

141
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:49,420
Aigoo... I can't believe I was spoken to like that by a child.

142
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:57,260
Let's talk for a moment.

143
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:02,430
The thing I thought I was the only one who knew...

144
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:06,260
It seems you already knew...

145
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:10,750
and everyone else did too.

146
00:11:11,950 --> 00:11:14,260
I was the only one

147
00:11:16,530 --> 00:11:19,120
who didn't know that everyone already knew.

148
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:22,940
Get yourself together. Is that the main problem right now?

149
00:11:22,940 --> 00:11:25,260
Is this the time for you to be like this?

150
00:11:25,260 --> 00:11:27,170
Are you going to give up

151
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:30,640
our brewery to Hong Joo Ga?

152
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,740
Is that what you're going to do?

153
00:11:35,180 --> 00:11:38,710
I can't. I can't do that.

154
00:11:38,710 --> 00:11:43,230
I'll even go to all the elders one by one and beg them on my knees.

155
00:11:43,230 --> 00:11:47,940
I won't move a single step until they agree to not give it up.

156
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:50,110
What are you going to do?

157
00:11:50,150 --> 00:11:52,420
What do you want to do?

158
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:55,930
You're the smart one. I'm telling you to think of something!

159
00:11:55,930 --> 00:11:59,620
Wait. Wait a minute.

160
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:01,610
Just give me one hour.

161
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:05,210
No, just give me 30 minutes.

162
00:12:05,210 --> 00:12:07,190
No...just ten minutes!

163
00:12:07,190 --> 00:12:09,240
Let me be alone.

164
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:13,530
Just ten minutes...alone.

165
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,730
Hey!

166
00:12:26,530 --> 00:12:29,550
You better not break down!

167
00:12:30,310 --> 00:12:32,860
I said you better not break down

168
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:35,860
and abandon me!

169
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:03,330
Mom

170
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:12,350
The phone is off and you're being re-directed to the voice mail system.

171
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:18,880
Mom.

172
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:23,070
I'll take on all the punishment,

173
00:13:23,070 --> 00:13:25,200
so don't come back.

174
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:28,750
Don't ever come back and just hide well.

175
00:13:31,250 --> 00:13:32,750
It's true.

176
00:13:32,750 --> 00:13:37,740
I thought that if we hid and lived on like nothing happened

177
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:40,650
everything would just go away.

178
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,910
But that's not the case, Mom.

179
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:47,500
You'll always be a witch until the day you die, Mom.

180
00:13:48,230 --> 00:13:50,360
And I'm the witch's daughter.

181
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:58,860
I'll burn in hell for you,

182
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:02,720
so don't ever come back, Mom.

183
00:14:12,690 --> 00:14:17,210
The wine is brewing well, Eun Jo.

184
00:14:38,990 --> 00:14:43,710
Because I'm the witch's daughter, does that make me a witch too?

185
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:48,480
Is it because I'm a witch that I've been caught under a spell?

186
00:14:49,850 --> 00:14:54,910
It seems I've completely forgotten who this person is

187
00:14:54,910 --> 00:14:58,670
and everything that he's done.

188
00:14:58,670 --> 00:15:02,850
I told you to be ready for anything that may happen.

189
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:08,520
And I told you to just watch what I'm doing.

190
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,590
Why are you crying?

191
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:16,800
That's why I really don't want to do anything.

192
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:19,630
I want to just leave everything in this person's hands

193
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:24,880
and just sit here and do nothing like these jars here.

194
00:15:27,130 --> 00:15:30,760
♫ It must be you.  ♫

195
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:35,870
♫ I cannot be without you. ♫

196
00:15:35,870 --> 00:15:39,820
I told you not to be shocked, but you're clearly shocked.

197
00:15:39,820 --> 00:15:44,280
I told you not to make a peep, but you're already crying.

198
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:48,210
You horrible woman.

199
00:15:49,870 --> 00:15:53,640
I also need to gradually start taking action now.

200
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:55,430
Do you know that?

201
00:15:58,050 --> 00:16:00,190
I'm also a little scared.

202
00:16:03,090 --> 00:16:07,170
Although I'm scared, I won't hide.

203
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:12,360
I'll handle things well and come back.

204
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:18,640
♫ I can't let you go a second time  ♫

205
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:24,340
♫ I'm saying I can't forget you and live.  ♫

206
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:30,470
And...the spell on the witch's daughter came to an end.

207
00:16:31,540 --> 00:16:34,350
When that person said he was scared,

208
00:16:34,350 --> 00:16:38,080
I also suddenly started feeling scared.

209
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,820
Stop right there.

210
00:16:41,570 --> 00:16:43,580
What is that you said you're going to do?

211
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:47,290
Where are you going now? What are you going to do?

212
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,730
I'll be back.

213
00:16:52,500 --> 00:16:57,080
Just do nothing and wait.

214
00:16:58,980 --> 00:17:02,800
Be good and wait for me.

215
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:07,040
And don't cry.

216
00:17:08,550 --> 00:17:14,620
♫ Can't you hear my voice? ♫

217
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:18,410
♫ Come to me. ♫

218
00:17:18,410 --> 00:17:21,880
♫ It must be you. ♫

219
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:25,470
♫ I cannot be without you. ♫

220
00:17:25,470 --> 00:17:32,450
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

221
00:17:32,450 --> 00:17:35,800
♫ The love I will protect ♫

222
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:39,800
♫ The love I love
Because for me ♫

223
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:46,100
♫ Yes, if it's just you, it is enough ♫

224
00:17:50,230 --> 00:17:53,640
How much do we have if we rake out everything we have?

225
00:17:53,660 --> 00:17:57,670
Is there somewhere we can go to find out what and how much we have?

226
00:17:57,670 --> 00:18:00,670
You don't know anything about the status of your assets?

227
00:18:00,670 --> 00:18:03,890
No. How would I know?

228
00:18:03,890 --> 00:18:07,290
That's why I'm looking into it now.

229
00:18:07,290 --> 00:18:10,910
After we find out, let's sell everything.

230
00:18:10,910 --> 00:18:13,960
But this is stuff we already know.

231
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,640
Where can we find out about the information we don't know about?

232
00:18:20,050 --> 00:18:22,160
Financial Supervisory Service

233
00:18:44,630 --> 00:18:46,010
What's the matter?

234
00:18:46,650 --> 00:18:48,760
We have no chance.

235
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:50,330
No chance?

236
00:18:50,350 --> 00:18:52,120
That's right.

237
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:54,510
That's what it was.

238
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:56,920
- What do you mean?
- They were going to buy our brewery

239
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:59,730
and get rid of it.

240
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,450
What did you say?

241
00:19:02,330 --> 00:19:05,450
Get rid of it? They said they were going to keep our name even if they buy it.

242
00:19:05,450 --> 00:19:07,080
It was a lie.

243
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:10,030
They were just going to get rid of the brand completely

244
00:19:10,030 --> 00:19:14,170
so that Hong Joo Ga's wine would take over the market.

245
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:18,790
Also, they said they would fully support me in developing yeast.

246
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:23,200
Then that would make me a researcher for Hong Joo Ga.

247
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,990
What?

248
00:19:27,930 --> 00:19:29,610
That's what their plan was.

249
00:19:29,610 --> 00:19:31,700
That's right.

250
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:37,130
Otherwise, there would be no reason for them to give us so much money for Dae Seong True Winemakers' shares.

251
00:19:37,130 --> 00:19:40,210
It didn't make any sense

252
00:19:40,210 --> 00:19:42,650
that they were offering so much more than the market price.

253
00:19:44,570 --> 00:19:46,880
From the beginning, those schemers...

254
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:50,070
What are you saying?

255
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:52,560
Explain it to me so I understand.

256
00:19:52,570 --> 00:19:54,130
Let's go first.

257
00:19:54,130 --> 00:19:58,730
There's nothing else we can do other than persuading the elders.

258
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:01,820
Jeong Woo, let's go.

259
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:09,930
Complete list of lobbying expenses ("Bribes" to government employees/ politicians)

260
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:21,950
Complete list of lobbying expenses

261
00:20:46,730 --> 00:20:51,600
Who was it? Who was the person that gave you this absurd information?

262
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:54,280
There's no need for you to know that.

263
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:55,940
It's not important either.

264
00:20:55,940 --> 00:21:00,550
So, what are you going to do about it? Let's hear what you're planning to do.

265
00:21:01,300 --> 00:21:03,310
You're obviously here to negotiate,

266
00:21:03,310 --> 00:21:05,490
so let's hear what you want and the details of your negotiation.

267
00:21:05,490 --> 00:21:07,810
Keep your mouth shut, Gi Jeong.

268
00:21:09,070 --> 00:21:11,490
It's not as if I didn't expect it

269
00:21:11,490 --> 00:21:15,690
but I didn't think it would be this bad, Father.

270
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:18,670
And also Hyung.

271
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:23,750
This information, it's not our company's.

272
00:21:25,510 --> 00:21:26,690
It isn't?

273
00:21:26,690 --> 00:21:28,730
No, it isn't.

274
00:21:28,730 --> 00:21:32,870
Why would you bring something so shabby and try such sloppy negotiations?

275
00:21:32,870 --> 00:21:34,760
What are you asking for, you punk?

276
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:38,300
Don't say anything, Gi Jeong. Don't say a word.

277
00:21:38,370 --> 00:21:41,340
If you're asking what I want for this,

278
00:21:41,340 --> 00:21:45,480
doesn't it mean you're acknowledging the content of this material, Hyung?

279
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:47,740
No.

280
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:49,690
No. I need to know what you're going to ask for,

281
00:21:49,690 --> 00:21:54,260
so I can agree or make a counteroffer.

282
00:21:55,320 --> 00:21:57,320
Tell me what you want.

283
00:21:57,320 --> 00:21:59,080
Gi Jeong.

284
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:02,190
You sneaky bastard!

285
00:22:02,870 --> 00:22:06,800
Because you had the most pitiful expression on your face,

286
00:22:06,800 --> 00:22:12,050
there was a moment when I blamed myself for making you suffer too much.

287
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:14,460
How could you...

288
00:22:14,460 --> 00:22:19,060
You don't know how shocked I was when I saw the amount of tax evasion, Hyung.

289
00:22:19,070 --> 00:22:24,510
That was when I first realized that money can exist in such large amounts in this world.

290
00:22:24,510 --> 00:22:26,750
You are quite skilled.

291
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:29,710
The way the financial statements were manipulated was just too amazing.

292
00:22:29,710 --> 00:22:33,480
Even someone like me, who studied in America for so long, was atonished.

293
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:35,730
Who was it?

294
00:22:35,730 --> 00:22:40,370
The legal and accounting team with such great teamwork?

295
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:43,350
So touching.

296
00:22:43,350 --> 00:22:46,270
Not to mention, even the list of political lobbyists—

297
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:48,280
Shut your mouth.

298
00:22:48,280 --> 00:22:53,190
If it weren't for these methods, do you think Hong Joo Ga could've grown in such a short time?

299
00:22:53,900 --> 00:22:56,140
By father's ability?

300
00:22:57,180 --> 00:23:01,680
Stop acting so naive and tell me what you want.

301
00:23:03,650 --> 00:23:06,130
This is enough for now.

302
00:23:06,130 --> 00:23:09,940
The request I want to make, you know it already.

303
00:23:09,940 --> 00:23:12,260
Keep your hands off of us.

304
00:23:13,190 --> 00:23:14,240
Us?

305
00:23:14,250 --> 00:23:19,840
Dae Seong True Winemakers. Don't touch us. That's my request.

306
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:24,120
Would you like to listen how ridiculous that request is, Hyung?

307
00:23:27,390 --> 00:23:30,160
I have to send a urgent message first.

308
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:32,110
Wait a moment.

309
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:40,060
[New e-mail received]

310
00:23:45,540 --> 00:23:47,620
Shut your mouth.

311
00:23:47,620 --> 00:23:52,390
If it weren't for these methods, do you think Hong Joo Ga could've grown in such a short time?

312
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:55,380
By father's ability?

313
00:23:56,710 --> 00:23:59,120
Stop acting so naive.

314
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:01,840
And tell me what you want.

315
00:24:01,840 --> 00:24:07,360
For today, I just needed you to acknowledge that this material belonged to Hong Joo Ga.

316
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:10,200
I didn't even have to work on you for too long.

317
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:13,060
Thanks for admitting it so easily, Hyung.

318
00:24:28,340 --> 00:24:30,400
It's no use, Hyung.

319
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:33,100
I've already transferred it to somewhere safe.

320
00:24:34,510 --> 00:24:37,830
I'll give you some time.

321
00:24:37,830 --> 00:24:42,790
By tomorrow... If you bought any stocks from the elders, give them all back.

322
00:24:42,790 --> 00:24:47,100
And if there is anything you wanted to buy from them, give up on it quickly.

323
00:25:11,610 --> 00:25:13,920
What are you thinking?

324
00:25:15,410 --> 00:25:20,190
Do you want me to just leave this alone?

325
00:25:24,650 --> 00:25:27,530
I'll do that so please go see to Joon Soo.

326
00:25:27,530 --> 00:25:29,380
Okay.

327
00:25:41,300 --> 00:25:44,410
We only need 2 of the elders on our side.

328
00:25:44,410 --> 00:25:46,820
If we put all our shares together is 40 percent.

329
00:25:46,820 --> 00:25:49,280
We just need another 11 percent.

330
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:53,800
So who do we need to persuade?

331
00:25:54,830 --> 00:25:57,330
The representative elder...

332
00:25:57,330 --> 00:25:59,450
And the family elder grandmother.

333
00:26:02,570 --> 00:26:05,170
Why Grandmother?

334
00:26:08,430 --> 00:26:12,560
If we can't convince the grandmother, then what happens?

335
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:16,380
Then we have to convince the other 12 elders.

336
00:26:22,130 --> 00:26:27,160
I'll go see my father's second cousin's grandmother...

337
00:26:27,160 --> 00:26:30,740
So Unni, you meet grandfather.

338
00:26:31,500 --> 00:26:33,050
No.

339
00:26:33,830 --> 00:26:36,320
I'll meet grandmother.

340
00:26:36,320 --> 00:26:38,210
I think that would be better.

341
00:26:39,590 --> 00:26:43,160
Better tomorrow morning than tonight, right?

342
00:26:54,150 --> 00:26:55,830
Eat your dinner.

343
00:26:55,830 --> 00:26:57,540
Please eat your dinner.

344
00:27:05,890 --> 00:27:09,480
Please open the door, Ahjumma! How can you do this, Ahjumma?

345
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:12,760
How can you do this after my mom abandoned me, Ahjumma?!

346
00:27:12,760 --> 00:27:14,810
Did you encourage her to abandon me?

347
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:17,960
Please open the door, Ahjumma!

348
00:27:29,190 --> 00:27:31,460
Keep your head down

349
00:27:32,530 --> 00:27:35,120
and continue to live with me.

350
00:27:35,120 --> 00:27:37,670
I told you that was your punishment!

351
00:28:53,870 --> 00:28:55,860
You guys go on ahead first.

352
00:28:55,860 --> 00:28:58,110
I left my cellphone.

353
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,740
I'll be right back.

354
00:29:20,740 --> 00:29:25,790
All you just have to do is do nothing and wait for me.

355
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:29,050
Wait for me. Like a good girl.

356
00:29:29,920 --> 00:29:31,930
Don't cry.

357
00:29:37,150 --> 00:29:39,830
You just received a new e-mail.

358
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:48,100
New mail
Sender: Hong Gi Hoon.
To: Dae Seong True Winemakers

359
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:53,600
This is a message written from Hon Gi Hoon's mobile phone

360
00:29:54,360 --> 00:29:55,630
1 attachment
AudioRecording01. wav

361
00:29:55,700 --> 00:29:58,400
Password required to open file

362
00:30:07,390 --> 00:30:09,810
PW: Dae Seong Do Ga

363
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:13,700
Re-enter password

364
00:31:05,420 --> 00:31:08,930
Let go of me. Who are you people? Who sent you?

365
00:31:08,940 --> 00:31:11,000
Did Hong Gi Jeong send you?

366
00:31:16,150 --> 00:31:18,600
Spanish History

367
00:31:28,540 --> 00:31:30,580
He hasn't come back yet?

368
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,760
He didn't contact you either?

369
00:31:33,760 --> 00:31:35,510
No.

370
00:31:37,160 --> 00:31:38,780
Okay.

371
00:31:38,780 --> 00:31:40,210
Go sleep.

372
00:31:40,210 --> 00:31:43,130
Wait. Can we talk for a bit?

373
00:31:43,130 --> 00:31:44,840
About what?

374
00:31:44,840 --> 00:31:45,880
Hyo Seon and I—

375
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,850
Just for a little bit.

376
00:31:49,520 --> 00:31:51,550
"Once upon a time, there was a man named Choi Man Jeong"

377
00:31:51,550 --> 00:31:54,510
"who lived in a village with his wife named Jo."

378
00:31:54,510 --> 00:31:58,350
"They lived happily together with two princesses."

379
00:31:58,350 --> 00:32:01,680
"Although there were happy times, there were also sad times."

380
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:03,560
"His wife fell ill,"

381
00:32:03,560 --> 00:32:06,430
"and passed away."

382
00:32:10,550 --> 00:32:14,200
Joon Soo, is it boring?

383
00:32:15,270 --> 00:32:18,070
Noona will read you a more interesting story, okay?

384
00:32:18,070 --> 00:32:22,110
Come here.

385
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:24,350
Should I read another one?

386
00:32:28,730 --> 00:32:30,730
Aigoo.

387
00:32:30,730 --> 00:32:34,600
Who knows if that kid is really your brother?

388
00:32:40,140 --> 00:32:42,310
I'll read you this one.

389
00:32:44,010 --> 00:32:47,590
- What did you say?
- I've saved up a bit till now.

390
00:32:47,590 --> 00:32:51,510
If it's not enough, I can even take out a loan.

391
00:32:53,540 --> 00:32:55,230
You're getting married?

392
00:32:55,230 --> 00:32:56,500
Yeah.

393
00:32:56,500 --> 00:32:57,510
Really?

394
00:32:57,510 --> 00:32:59,340
Yeah.

395
00:32:59,340 --> 00:33:01,690
I can just get a place with one room

396
00:33:01,690 --> 00:33:04,560
and a kitchen for now.

397
00:33:05,310 --> 00:33:07,020
Starting from that,

398
00:33:07,020 --> 00:33:09,880
the number of spoons and bowls in the house can grow from there.

399
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:12,420
Can't I just live like that?

400
00:33:13,460 --> 00:33:15,810
I thought it would be in a few years.

401
00:33:15,810 --> 00:33:21,750
By then, I would be able to do a lot more for you.

402
00:33:22,620 --> 00:33:26,380
But right now, I can't help you with anything.

403
00:33:27,220 --> 00:33:32,550
But...I can't make you wait until I have the ability.

404
00:33:33,230 --> 00:33:35,010
All right.

405
00:33:35,010 --> 00:33:37,990
I'll help you, whether it's a loan or whatever.

406
00:33:41,570 --> 00:33:43,020
Go to sleep.

407
00:33:47,890 --> 00:33:50,490
That's not it. I meant...

408
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:57,400
I'm afraid if you stay here any longer, you'll get sick.

409
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:10,830
We probably can't sell everything right away.

410
00:34:10,830 --> 00:34:13,870
We don't know when there will be buyers.

411
00:34:13,890 --> 00:34:17,720
We can put them out for sale, but we can't rely on this.

412
00:34:21,700 --> 00:34:24,850
When will we get the money for the rice wine we sold?

413
00:34:24,900 --> 00:34:28,900
How much do we have? How much do we need?

414
00:34:29,660 --> 00:34:33,840
It's worth quite a lot, but you know...

415
00:34:33,900 --> 00:34:38,600
That's all to be shared with the elders.

416
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:43,750
I think it'll be better

417
00:34:44,600 --> 00:34:48,480
for me to meet Grandmother.

418
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:51,620
No, I'll go.

419
00:34:52,550 --> 00:34:57,760
I am so angry at Halmoni for insulting Joon Soo.

420
00:35:00,390 --> 00:35:02,400
You too, right?

421
00:35:09,380 --> 00:35:13,500
Come with me. I want to show you something.

422
00:35:17,560 --> 00:35:19,440
I told you to come.

423
00:35:48,540 --> 00:35:52,280
This is my mom's dress.

424
00:35:53,770 --> 00:35:55,340
Mom...

425
00:35:57,130 --> 00:35:59,610
Our mom now...

426
00:35:59,700 --> 00:36:04,800
When she first came to our house, her clothes got ruined,

427
00:36:04,820 --> 00:36:08,120
so I gave her this to wear.

428
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:13,220
At that time...

429
00:36:13,860 --> 00:36:16,130
seeing Mom wearing my mom's clothes,

430
00:36:16,130 --> 00:36:18,870
I felt that if I couldn't have her right away,

431
00:36:18,870 --> 00:36:21,270
I would die.

432
00:36:21,300 --> 00:36:25,700
You are really pretty.

433
00:36:26,200 --> 00:36:28,340
Why are you like this?

434
00:36:31,580 --> 00:36:33,430
I don't know.

435
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:36,820
My tears just kept running down...

436
00:36:38,390 --> 00:36:42,540
Within my desire to have her,

437
00:36:42,540 --> 00:36:46,430
I also already felt the fear of her being taken away from me.

438
00:36:47,270 --> 00:36:48,700
Do you understand?

439
00:36:48,700 --> 00:36:51,620
I wanted to have her,

440
00:36:51,620 --> 00:36:55,980
but at the same time, I was also anxious that she'd be taken away from me anytime.

441
00:36:55,980 --> 00:37:00,460
So I was determined

442
00:37:00,460 --> 00:37:03,140
not to lose her.

443
00:37:05,260 --> 00:37:10,900
This is the bible my mom always read

444
00:37:11,860 --> 00:37:14,500
and the rosary that she prayed with.

445
00:37:17,470 --> 00:37:19,320
Look at this.

446
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:23,350
This is a photo of Dad when he was young.

447
00:37:24,330 --> 00:37:27,150
He looks exactly like Joon Soo, doesn't he?

448
00:37:44,990 --> 00:37:49,130
If I see your sulking face, I don't think I'd be able to leave.

449
00:37:49,130 --> 00:37:50,980
So I'm leaving like this.

450
00:37:52,030 --> 00:37:53,970
I'll leave alone now,

451
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:56,650
and in the future, I'll grab your hand tightly

452
00:37:56,650 --> 00:37:58,560
and take you to Ushuaia.

453
00:37:58,560 --> 00:38:02,670
I'll even take you to the moon and stars.

454
00:38:48,630 --> 00:38:50,790
Don't run away somewhere again,

455
00:38:50,790 --> 00:38:53,780
don't go anywhere and just wait at home.

456
00:38:54,420 --> 00:38:58,060
I'll endure everything with the thought of you waiting.

457
00:38:58,060 --> 00:39:01,370
I hope you'll also endure everything with the thought of me returning.

458
00:39:02,250 --> 00:39:04,690
I like you, Eun Jo.

459
00:39:04,690 --> 00:39:07,360
You're my favorite in this whole world.

460
00:39:08,240 --> 00:39:10,000
I love you.

461
00:39:12,030 --> 00:39:14,970
If we had to separate for a while,

462
00:39:14,970 --> 00:39:18,030
I wanted to write this kind of letter to you.

463
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:20,930
Don't go anywhere and wait for me.

464
00:39:20,930 --> 00:39:23,100
I love you, Eun Jo.

465
00:39:23,100 --> 00:39:24,610
A letter saying all that.

466
00:39:25,300 --> 00:39:28,220
I really wanted to write a letter

467
00:39:28,300 --> 00:39:32,900
that would make your heart flutter and wait for me, but ...

468
00:39:33,640 --> 00:39:36,730
I have to cross a river of no return.

469
00:39:36,730 --> 00:39:41,090
As the coward I am, instead of telling you to wait for me,

470
00:39:41,090 --> 00:39:44,110
I have to ask you to stop me.

471
00:39:45,500 --> 00:39:47,630
Can you stop me?

472
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:51,890
Eun Jo...a fool just like Hong Gi Hoon

473
00:39:51,890 --> 00:39:54,480
who can't cry even when your knees are bleeding...

474
00:39:55,890 --> 00:40:00,350
If you hold me back, I think I can stop here.

475
00:40:01,500 --> 00:40:06,400
Before I get on the train, grab me, Eun Jo.

476
00:40:14,690 --> 00:40:17,600
My tears couldn't even fall out.

477
00:40:17,600 --> 00:40:21,800
My chest felt so tight thst I couldn't even bresthe.

478
00:40:22,960 --> 00:40:26,820
"If you hold me back, I think I can stop here."

479
00:40:26,820 --> 00:40:31,160
"If you hold me back, I think I can stop here."

480
00:40:33,200 --> 00:40:37,500
You couldn't stop, so you came all the way here? Is that what you were saying?

481
00:40:37,580 --> 00:40:44,830
♫ Where you can't hold me again  ♫

482
00:40:44,830 --> 00:40:50,260
♫ I ask again about the way.  ♫

483
00:40:50,260 --> 00:40:53,920
♫ Saying I want to see you  ♫

484
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:59,230
♫ and hold you again ♫

485
00:40:59,230 --> 00:41:05,190
♫ While looking at heaven I'm praying ♫

486
00:41:05,190 --> 00:41:09,310
♫ It must be you. ♫

487
00:41:09,310 --> 00:41:12,820
I'll even take you to the moon and stars.

488
00:41:13,460 --> 00:41:15,050
When?

489
00:41:15,640 --> 00:41:17,700
Can you stop me?

490
00:41:18,770 --> 00:41:20,570
How?

491
00:41:21,590 --> 00:41:25,950
If you hold me back, I think I can stop here.

492
00:41:27,160 --> 00:41:32,380
This person...was clinging onto me like clutching at straws.

493
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:36,010
Eun Jo...a fool just like Hong Gi Hoon

494
00:41:36,020 --> 00:41:38,840
who can't even cry when your knees are bleeding.

495
00:41:40,290 --> 00:41:45,160
That person's knees were also bleeding...

496
00:41:45,870 --> 00:41:47,930
Can you stop me?

497
00:41:50,070 --> 00:41:52,220
If I had known

498
00:41:52,220 --> 00:41:57,150
a cruel, useless 18 year old brat

499
00:41:57,150 --> 00:41:58,710
was the only person in the world

500
00:41:58,710 --> 00:42:02,340
who could hold back that person,

501
00:42:03,070 --> 00:42:04,630
I also...

502
00:42:05,290 --> 00:42:08,800
wouldn't have had any reason to cry

503
00:42:08,830 --> 00:42:12,510
like a bird calling my own name.

504
00:42:13,380 --> 00:42:16,920
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

505
00:42:16,920 --> 00:42:20,220
♫ The love I will protect ♫

506
00:42:20,220 --> 00:42:24,290
♫ The love I love
Because for me ♫

507
00:42:24,290 --> 00:42:32,460
♫ Yes, if it's just you, it is enough ♫

508
00:42:32,460 --> 00:42:40,570
♫ because you are the only one I love. ♫

509
00:43:14,960 --> 00:43:17,250
Why did you come so early in the morning?

510
00:43:23,320 --> 00:43:25,140
What's wrong with you?

511
00:43:26,070 --> 00:43:29,860
That person didn't come home?

512
00:43:30,670 --> 00:43:32,490
He didn't.

513
00:43:33,620 --> 00:43:35,520
I can't reach him on the phone.

514
00:43:35,520 --> 00:43:37,370
I couldn't either.

515
00:43:38,290 --> 00:43:40,480
Something must have happened.

516
00:43:41,130 --> 00:43:43,010
What could it be?

517
00:43:43,870 --> 00:43:46,990
He told me he'll be right back so to just wait for him.

518
00:43:48,660 --> 00:43:50,540
If he said he'll come back,

519
00:43:51,960 --> 00:43:53,930
he would have been back by now.

520
00:44:01,290 --> 00:44:02,840
Noona!

521
00:44:23,700 --> 00:44:25,770
Why is his car here?

522
00:44:26,730 --> 00:44:29,340
If his car is here, shouldn't he be here also?

523
00:44:32,360 --> 00:44:35,230
- Jeong Woo. - Yes.

524
00:44:37,090 --> 00:44:39,440
Something happened, right?

525
00:44:41,730 --> 00:44:43,530
Right?

526
00:45:09,270 --> 00:45:11,500
Tell me what's going on. This is really frustrating!

527
00:45:11,500 --> 00:45:12,650
Jeong Woo.

528
00:45:12,650 --> 00:45:13,900
What?

529
00:45:13,900 --> 00:45:17,420
I'm a little anxious right now.

530
00:45:17,420 --> 00:45:19,360
Yes.

531
00:45:19,360 --> 00:45:20,740
Go tell Hyo Seon...

532
00:45:20,740 --> 00:45:22,400
What?

533
00:45:22,400 --> 00:45:26,680
Tell Hyo Seon to go meet with my father's second cousin's grandmother.

534
00:45:28,680 --> 00:45:30,560
And also...

535
00:45:36,400 --> 00:45:38,500
[Re-enter password]

536
00:45:42,000 --> 00:45:44,400
[Re-enter password]

537
00:45:52,970 --> 00:45:54,960
Are you okay?

538
00:45:56,750 --> 00:45:58,690
I'm alright.

539
00:46:01,090 --> 00:46:05,300
No. I'm not alright.

540
00:46:07,440 --> 00:46:10,810
No. I'm fine.

541
00:46:12,290 --> 00:46:14,720
What was the 4th thing he wanted to say?

542
00:46:14,720 --> 00:46:17,440
He said he had 4 things to say to me.

543
00:46:18,070 --> 00:46:22,960
He only told me 3 and said he'll tell me the last one later...

544
00:46:23,610 --> 00:46:25,720
[Things to say to MMM]

545
00:46:36,330 --> 00:46:38,560
PW: MMM

546
00:46:40,450 --> 00:46:43,260
Downloading file

547
00:47:18,340 --> 00:47:20,340
He left earlier.

548
00:47:20,340 --> 00:47:21,960
Where to?

549
00:47:21,960 --> 00:47:23,500
That I don't know...

550
00:47:54,460 --> 00:47:56,920
I heard you haven't eaten anything.

551
00:47:58,580 --> 00:48:00,670
You shouldn't be like that.

552
00:48:00,670 --> 00:48:03,280
You need to eat well.

553
00:48:04,670 --> 00:48:07,440
Go and bring some food for this guy.

554
00:48:17,560 --> 00:48:21,210
I feel bad for having to go this far.

555
00:48:22,330 --> 00:48:26,980
But, I needed some time.

556
00:48:27,990 --> 00:48:30,620
I have no intention to mistreat you at all.

557
00:48:31,650 --> 00:48:35,080
Father and mother's divorce hearing will be tomorrow.

558
00:48:35,080 --> 00:48:38,040
Then a few days after that, there will be a shareholder's meeting.

559
00:48:38,800 --> 00:48:41,060
Between the divorce hearing and the shareholder's meeting,

560
00:48:41,060 --> 00:48:44,290
the Dae Seong brewery issue will be resolved.

561
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:47,670
You just need to stay here for a few days.

562
00:48:51,340 --> 00:48:55,590
I didn't know you'd resort to the point of being a gangster, Hyung Gi Jeong.

563
00:48:57,700 --> 00:48:59,920
It was Director Park, wasn't it?

564
00:49:01,310 --> 00:49:03,610
The person who sent you the documents.

565
00:49:03,680 --> 00:49:09,650
How could you handle things so carelessly, Hyung?

566
00:49:09,650 --> 00:49:12,170
It is Director Park...

567
00:49:12,170 --> 00:49:13,940
Right?

568
00:49:14,560 --> 00:49:19,320
I also hope what I'm thinking won't happen.

569
00:49:20,830 --> 00:49:25,410
Even if I don't do it, you're already done for.

570
00:49:26,650 --> 00:49:27,920
What did you say?

571
00:49:27,980 --> 00:49:32,540
When I see you resorting to these tactics, I can finally understand.

572
00:49:33,160 --> 00:49:36,410
How weak of a person you are, Hyung.

573
00:50:15,940 --> 00:50:18,840
It'll be over soon, Gi Hoon.

574
00:50:19,970 --> 00:50:24,690
Don't waste your energy and just take care of yourself.

575
00:50:33,530 --> 00:50:37,210
The request I want to make, you know it already.

576
00:50:37,230 --> 00:50:40,450
Keep your hands off of us.

577
00:50:40,480 --> 00:50:41,550
Us?

578
00:50:41,550 --> 00:50:45,150
Dae Seong True Winemakers. Don't touch us.

579
00:50:45,150 --> 00:50:47,110
That's my request.

580
00:50:47,110 --> 00:50:51,400
Would you like to listen how ridiculous that request is, Hyung?

581
00:50:54,630 --> 00:50:57,400
I have to send an urgent message first.

582
00:51:01,180 --> 00:51:02,680
Jeong Woo.

583
00:51:02,680 --> 00:51:04,150
Yes.

584
00:51:05,100 --> 00:51:06,780
That person...

585
00:51:07,800 --> 00:51:10,910
It seems like he's being held by his so-called Hyung.

586
00:51:11,510 --> 00:51:13,460
What did you say?

587
00:51:13,460 --> 00:51:15,370
That person...

588
00:51:16,550 --> 00:51:20,960
he tried to negotiate with Hong Joo Ga's weakness.

589
00:51:22,240 --> 00:51:28,070
I think that information is somewhere inside this computer.

590
00:51:32,040 --> 00:51:34,380
Put the computer in the car, Jeong Woo.

591
00:51:34,380 --> 00:51:35,990
What did you say?

592
00:51:36,590 --> 00:51:40,080
I have to exchange it for him.

593
00:51:45,230 --> 00:51:49,050
What's Hyo Seon doing?

594
00:51:50,760 --> 00:51:52,770
Grandmother.

595
00:51:55,700 --> 00:51:58,930
Until you come out to talk to me...

596
00:51:59,610 --> 00:52:04,110
I won't take a single step out of this spot.

597
00:52:06,270 --> 00:52:07,230
Please?

598
00:52:07,230 --> 00:52:11,350
I have nothing to say to you child, so go home immediately.

599
00:52:11,350 --> 00:52:13,860
Grandmother.

600
00:52:14,820 --> 00:52:21,660
I'll remember what you said about Joon Soo until I die.

601
00:52:23,100 --> 00:52:28,460
Even after you pass away, I won't forget it at all.

602
00:52:28,460 --> 00:52:31,330
I'll hate you, Grandmother!

603
00:52:32,650 --> 00:52:37,490
Because grandmother is like this, my mom can't come back home.

604
00:52:39,310 --> 00:52:41,570
If Mom doesn't come home,

605
00:52:42,150 --> 00:52:48,000
are you going to take care of Joon Soo?

606
00:52:49,300 --> 00:52:53,340
You'll sell Dae Seong True Winemakers to someone else,

607
00:52:53,340 --> 00:52:58,540
and then use that money to send our Joon Soo to study abroad?

608
00:52:59,580 --> 00:53:04,550
After marrying me off, are you going to marry our unni off too?

609
00:53:05,440 --> 00:53:09,970
Are you going to take care of our entire family?

610
00:53:11,220 --> 00:53:13,950
Grandmother!

611
00:53:13,950 --> 00:53:15,900
Grandmother.

612
00:53:16,920 --> 00:53:19,360
Grandmother...

613
00:53:29,160 --> 00:53:31,380
I came to stay here with you.

614
00:53:32,730 --> 00:53:35,370
Noona told me to be with you.

615
00:53:38,100 --> 00:53:43,070
What is Eun Jo doing?

616
00:53:43,070 --> 00:53:45,200
She had to go somewhere.

617
00:53:47,590 --> 00:53:49,100
Where?

618
00:53:49,100 --> 00:53:51,120
I don't know either.

619
00:53:53,020 --> 00:53:55,530
Who can overcome Eun Jo's stubbornness?

620
00:54:18,860 --> 00:54:23,800
Hong Gi Jeong, this is Goo Eun Jo.

621
00:54:24,630 --> 00:54:26,780
You kidnapped Hong Gi Hoon, right?

622
00:54:26,780 --> 00:54:30,090
What are you talking about? Kidnapping?

623
00:54:31,690 --> 00:54:34,260
He's my younger brother.

624
00:54:34,260 --> 00:54:38,230
Have you ever seen an older brother kidnap his younger brother?

625
00:54:38,250 --> 00:54:40,980
I thought you said he wasn't your younger brother.

626
00:54:40,980 --> 00:54:44,430
I definitely heard you say he was not.

627
00:54:45,230 --> 00:54:47,460
Since I'm not as meticulous as Hong Gi Hoon

628
00:54:47,460 --> 00:54:50,320
I didn't even think about recording our past conversation.

629
00:54:50,320 --> 00:54:52,990
But, I definitely remember you saying it.

630
00:54:53,020 --> 00:54:56,240
You said: I only have one brother named, Hong Gi Tae.

631
00:54:56,250 --> 00:54:58,890
Hong Gi Hoon is not my brother.

632
00:54:59,560 --> 00:55:02,250
But he is my father's son.

633
00:55:03,600 --> 00:55:08,480
I can see how you've been treating your half-brother.

634
00:55:08,480 --> 00:55:11,700
Get to the point of what it is you have to say.

635
00:55:12,600 --> 00:55:15,490
If it's about Gi Hoon, I don't know anything.

636
00:55:15,490 --> 00:55:18,300
So we'll just end this call immediately.

637
00:55:18,300 --> 00:55:21,290
Release him immediately, Hong Gi Jeong.

638
00:55:21,290 --> 00:55:25,420
I won't listen to you. All you have to do is listen to me.

639
00:55:26,360 --> 00:55:30,060
At first, I left home thinking of exchanging these materials

640
00:55:30,060 --> 00:55:35,350
I have in my car for Hong Gi Hoon.

641
00:55:36,070 --> 00:55:41,580
But if he was someone who was worried about his own safety,

642
00:55:41,590 --> 00:55:46,230
I think he wouldn't have done this in the first place.

643
00:55:48,120 --> 00:55:52,250
If he was a man who was concerned about his own safety a long time ago...

644
00:55:52,260 --> 00:55:59,480
A very long time ago, he wouldn't have asked me to stop him.

645
00:56:00,500 --> 00:56:03,200
I couldn't do anything back then...

646
00:56:03,230 --> 00:56:05,030
So what can I do now?

647
00:56:05,030 --> 00:56:07,920
Those are the thoughts running through my head.

648
00:56:09,540 --> 00:56:14,900
He would not want me to get him out so easily.

649
00:56:16,420 --> 00:56:18,240
Hong Gi Jeong.

650
00:56:18,860 --> 00:56:22,880
I'm in front of the Prosecutor's Office right now.

651
00:56:24,460 --> 00:56:27,120
I plan on getting it all done at once.

652
00:56:27,120 --> 00:56:31,270
I will report all that you did to Dae Seong True Winemakers.

653
00:56:31,270 --> 00:56:34,430
I'm going to hand over these documents and the voice recording

654
00:56:34,430 --> 00:56:38,730
and even reveal Hong Hi Hoon's real identity.

655
00:56:40,740 --> 00:56:45,580
I don't know what's inside these documents,

656
00:56:45,580 --> 00:56:47,930
but just from the audio recording,

657
00:56:47,960 --> 00:56:53,140
even a fool can tell you've done extremely horrible things.

658
00:56:53,140 --> 00:56:55,770
Let's meet and talk in person.

659
00:56:55,770 --> 00:56:58,140
I thought about this a lot,

660
00:56:58,160 --> 00:57:00,860
and I know this the right thing to do.

661
00:57:00,860 --> 00:57:04,190
No matter how many of Dae Seong True Winemakers' stocks you obtain,

662
00:57:04,190 --> 00:57:08,950
Or even so the name of Dae Seong True Winemakers gets erased in our country forever,

663
00:57:08,950 --> 00:57:10,900
this is the right thing to do.

664
00:57:12,280 --> 00:57:17,340
Even our late father would agree that this is the right thing to do.

665
00:57:17,340 --> 00:57:19,440
Look here, Goo Eun Jo.

666
00:57:19,440 --> 00:57:21,680
Look here, Hong Gi Jeong.

667
00:57:22,420 --> 00:57:24,850
But the main reason I'm going to do this is that...

668
00:57:26,000 --> 00:57:31,220
I don't want that person, Hong Gi Hoon,

669
00:57:31,220 --> 00:57:35,290
to be ashamed anymore.

670
00:57:35,290 --> 00:57:36,530
Look here!

671
00:57:36,530 --> 00:57:40,330
That person couldn't come to me because he always felt ashamed.

672
00:57:40,980 --> 00:57:45,620
He never said what he truly felt because he felt too guilty.

673
00:57:46,340 --> 00:57:48,980
And I always said something different than what I felt in my heart.

674
00:57:49,770 --> 00:57:56,450
There was not even once that I said any warm words to that person.

675
00:57:57,470 --> 00:58:02,250
So if I just hand this over to you to get him freed,

676
00:58:03,380 --> 00:58:08,600
he and I will never have a chance.

677
00:58:11,890 --> 00:58:13,770
Hong Gi Jeong...

678
00:58:15,020 --> 00:58:19,570
If the fact that Hong Gi Jeong kidnapped his own younger brother, becomes known somehow...

679
00:58:19,570 --> 00:58:21,810
It can cause you big trouble.

680
00:58:23,070 --> 00:58:27,050
I will give you some time before I get into that building...

681
00:58:27,050 --> 00:58:29,470
so please release him.

682
00:58:29,470 --> 00:58:32,090
And let him call me.

683
00:58:33,660 --> 00:58:36,170
Then I won't need to go in there

684
00:58:36,170 --> 00:58:42,280
to tell them that you kidnapped your younger brother.

685
00:58:42,320 --> 00:58:44,520
Goodbye.

686
00:59:31,800 --> 00:59:35,460
Make a call to Lawyer Kim.

687
01:00:15,590 --> 01:00:17,830
Incoming call

688
01:00:20,430 --> 01:00:22,180
Hello?

689
01:00:23,130 --> 01:00:24,500
Hello?

690
01:00:24,510 --> 01:00:28,920
Roll your window down a bit so that I can see your face.

691
01:00:44,650 --> 01:00:46,840
Who told you to do this?

692
01:00:48,860 --> 01:00:50,190
Are you okay?

693
01:00:50,190 --> 01:00:51,790
Don't you see it?

694
01:00:51,790 --> 01:00:53,980
I'm fine.

695
01:00:57,680 --> 01:01:01,950
That's enough. Go home.

696
01:01:01,950 --> 01:01:03,690
You can't.

697
01:01:04,480 --> 01:01:09,270
You can't take those files and do what you're thinking.

698
01:01:11,600 --> 01:01:14,700
It's the only way to save Dae Seong Do Ga.

699
01:01:16,650 --> 01:01:24,790
♫  I'm secretly smiling  ♫

700
01:01:24,790 --> 01:01:27,740
♫  Love leaves again this way  ♫

701
01:01:27,740 --> 01:01:29,800
What are you doing?

702
01:01:32,400 --> 01:01:34,610
I asked what you are doing?!

703
01:01:39,570 --> 01:01:46,150
♫  In the sadness you left in the longing  ♫

704
01:01:46,150 --> 01:01:51,720
♫  I walk this street again  ♫

705
01:01:51,760 --> 01:01:54,440
♫  I am living day after day  ♫

706
01:01:54,440 --> 01:01:55,300
Eun Jo!

707
01:01:55,300 --> 01:01:59,040
♫  I am living day after day  ♫

708
01:01:59,080 --> 01:02:08,060
♫  In your name when tears appear  ♫

709
01:02:08,060 --> 01:02:11,950
♫  I can't bear it  ♫

710
01:02:11,950 --> 01:02:15,520
♫  So I can't laugh  ♫

711
01:02:15,520 --> 01:02:25,830
♫  I call out your name again.  ♫

712
01:02:38,240 --> 01:02:41,830
♫  It must be you  ♫

713
01:02:41,830 --> 01:02:45,760
♫  I cannot be without you  ♫

714
01:02:45,790 --> 01:02:52,720
♫  Like this for another day, month or year  ♫

715
01:02:52,720 --> 01:02:56,380
♫  I don't mind even if I am hurt  ♫

716
01:02:56,380 --> 01:03:00,330
♫  I don't mind even if my heart breaks  ♫

717
01:03:00,330 --> 01:03:07,650
♫  because, yes, you are the only one I love.  ♫

718
01:03:21,030 --> 01:03:27,020
♫  I'm saying I can't let you go a second time  ♫
